caramos-app-center (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite the CaramOS App Center in Python, GTK4 and libadwaita (#46).
  * One-page app picker: office suite (ONLYOFFICE, WPS Office, LibreOffice),
    browsers, chat and everyday tools, each with strengths and weaknesses.
    The recommended apps are preselected and one button installs them.
    Vietnam Linux Family colours, light and dark.
  * Opens on its own in the live session and at the first login after
    installing, and from the Desktop or the menu any time. Closing the
    first-run picker tells where to find it again.
  * "See more" opens each category on apps.vietnamlinuxfamily.net. The store
    list stays hidden (--store) until it can use the site's API.
  * Apps come from Flathub when the publisher maintains them there, otherwise
    from the publisher's own package (WPS, Chrome, Edge, Coc Coc, Zoom, Zalo
    with calls, Microsoft core fonts).
  * Privileged helper behind polkit that only accepts app IDs from the
    packaged catalog; replaces the password piped to sudo in the old app.
  * Published as signed GitHub releases that caramos-ota installs and keeps
    up to date; no PPA.

 -- Vietnam Linux Family <developer@vietnamlinuxfamily.net>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:44:04 +0700
